  "branch_scope": "Partial northward West Spitsbergen slope-current corridor from 73 N editorial Barents-departure approach to 79.6 N pre-branching gate. Exclude upstream Norwegian Atlantic routes, Barents inflow, offshore Front Current feeder, recirculation, shelf/fjord intrusions and downstream Svalbard/Yermak/Yermak Pass branches as target identities. Broad northward maxima do not independently resolve these branches or Atlantic Water membership. Source 1,000 m glider limit is not a current bottom; 20–500 m averaged velocities and source water-mass thresholds are not adopted as model layer boundaries. Spitsbergen Atlantic naming is not merged. This separately labeled20–500m diagnostic permits subsurface flow without surface qualification. It does not establish thermal Atlantic Water membership or replace the original surface-screened cases.",
